{"id":"vod_bf_33630","vodId":"33630","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"天降之物","name_cn":"天降之物","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-34/decfd38967704c6ac7b756d40f600d47.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在和平宁静的空美町，平凡的少年樱井智树（保志总一朗 配音）过着独居的生活。每晚，智树都会梦见有天使从天而降，虽然被梦境所困扰，但智树的每一天依然能称得上是风平浪静。某一日，名叫伊卡洛斯（早见沙织 配音）的不明生物降落到了智树的身边，有着一张可爱面孔的她，后背上却长着硕大的羽翼。难道梦境中的一切变为现实了？　　善良的智树收留了伊卡洛斯，他的温柔和陈恳打动了这位本该无情的天使。之后，妮姆芙（野水伊织 配音）和阿斯特蕾亚（福原香织 配音）两位天使也被智树感化留在了他的身边。这些天使们从何而来？为何而来？在她们的背后，似乎隐藏了许多不为人知的秘密。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 09:16:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/tianjiangzhiwu/第14集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snap